    "description": "StartFragment\n\n# Library Book Management API\n\nA REST API built with Node.js, Express, MongoDB, and Mongoose to manage authors and books.\n\nStartFragment\n\n## Base URL\n\n`{{baseUrl}}`\n\n## Available operations\n\n- Create, retrieve, update, and delete authors.\n    \n- Retrieve books written by a specific author.\n    \n- Create, retrieve, update, and delete books.\n    \n- Filter books by genre, author, availability, and title search.\n    \n\nEndFragment",
